        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Job sharing employees shall be entitled to share the full Agency paid insurance benefits for one (1) full-time position based on a pro rate of regular hours scheduled per week or per month whatever is appropriate. In any event, the Agency contribution for insurance benefits in a job share position is limited to the amount authorized for one (1) full-time employee. Each job share employee shall have the right to pay the difference between the Agency paid insurance benefits and the full premium amount through payroll deduction.",
